# Confidential denylist — copy to .sanitise-denylist and fill in. NEVER commit the real one.
# One term per line, case-insensitive, matched as a whole word. Blank lines and # comments ignored.
#
# Include, for every client and engagement:
#   - the client's name, trading name, and any abbreviation
#   - their end client
#   - their sector, domain, country, programme, or named capability
#   - product names, service names, repository names, hostnames
#   - any named individual
#
# Example shape only:
# acmeanalytics
# acme
# widgetcorp
# some-internal-service-name
